{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"alias":"stormproof-stormy-toad","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\nOn the shared tickets branch, `rebar store fsck` reports 1 counted `ORPHAN_EVENT`. The same row appears on the production MCP clone and on the operator clone, observed 2026-11-04 01:50 PST:\n\n- File: `77b6-868f-f4bd-461f/1793763291917454423-f07d2f27-191e-4bd7-9091-1b10efb7ed38-TAG_DELTA.json`\n- Status: tracked, not retired.\n\nHistory of the ticket on `tickets`:\n- `2c7a33d9032` — 2026-11-03 19:34:53 PST — author Rebar Bot (MCP) — TAG_DELTA\n- `c1343e50cd2` — 2026-11-03 19:35:17 PST — author Rebar Bot Nava (operator host) — COMPACT, which wrote SNAPSHOT `4febf54c`\n\nThat SNAPSHOT's `source_event_uuids` holds only the CREATE (5cdd6767) and the LINK (a993ab40). The TAG_DELTA's HLC timestamp precedes the snapshot's, so the snapshot replays without the tag change.\n\nHypothesis (untested): the operator host's fold read the ticket directory before its clone received the MCP server's TAG_DELTA, then committed a snapshot whose horizon covers it. The 2 writers were 24 s apart on different clones.\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Check whether the fold's source selection admits events newer than the clone's last fetch, or whether the union merge brought the TAG_DELTA in after the snapshot was built.\n2. Reproduce with 2 clones: one writes an event, and the other folds before fetching it.\n3. Repair the ticket with `rebar store fsck --repair-snapshots` only after the cause is understood.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The cause is recorded on this ticket with a 2-clone reproduction.\n- [ ] `rebar store fsck --output json` reports 0 `orphan_event` for 77b6-868f-f4bd-461f.","id":"2977-df28-8e9f-4a50","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["tracker","compaction"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Cross-clone fold left a TAG_DELTA outside the SNAPSHOT on 77b6-868f"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1793785944831211001,"uuid":"8aadc8dd-b0da-4e47-84ef-177ca3a9b957"}